    "description": "Embedded Home Assistant Dashboard for IoT monitoring and control",
    "html_content": "<!-- ====== EMBED HOME ASSISTANT (ERPNext Custom HTML Block) ====== -->\n<div style=\"box-sizing:border-box; width:100%; max-width:100%; margin:0; padding:0;\">\n  <!-- Judul / Toolbar kecil (opsional) -->\n  <div style=\"display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between; gap:.5rem; margin:0 0 .75rem 0;\">\n    <h2 style=\"margin:0; font:600 1.25rem/1.3 system-ui, -apple-system, Segoe UI, Roboto, sans-serif;\">\n      Home Assistant (Embedded)\n    </h2>\n    <a href=\"https://ha.hcm-lab.id/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"\n       style=\"text-decoration:none; font:500 .9rem/1 system-ui, -apple-system, Segoe UI, Roboto, sans-serif; padding:.45rem .7rem; border-radius:.6rem; border:1px solid #ddd;\">\n      Buka di Tab Baru\n    </a>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Kontainer responsif -->\n  <div style=\"\n    position:relative;\n    width:100%;\n    height:85vh;              /* Tinggi area: silakan ubah (mis. 70vh/90vh/1200px) */\n    border-radius:12px;\n    overflow:hidden;\n    border:1px solid #e5e7eb;\n    box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.06);\n    background:#0b0f14;       /* warna latar belakang saat loading */\n  \">\n    <iframe\n      src=\"https://ha.hcm-lab.id/\"\n      title=\"Home Assistant\"\n      loading=\"lazy\"\n      style=\"position:absolute; inset:0; width:100%; height:100%; border:0;\"\n      allow=\"fullscreen; geolocation; clipboard-read; clipboard-write; microphone; camera\"\n      referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"\n    ></iframe>\n    <!-- Fallback kecil saat iFrame gagal dimuat -->\n    <noscript>\n      <div style=\"position:absolute; inset:0; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; color:#fff;\">\n        Aktifkan JavaScript untuk memuat Home Assistant.\n      </div>\n    </noscript>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Catatan kecil (opsional) -->\n  <p style=\"margin:.5rem 0 0; color:#6b7280; font:.85rem/1.4 system-ui, -apple-system, Segoe UI, Roboto, sans-serif;\">\n    Jika tampilan kosong, kemungkinan server Home Assistant memblokir embedding (CSP/X-Frame-Options).\n  </p>\n</div>\n<!-- ====== /EMBED HOME ASSISTANT ====== -->"
  }
